<title>USA: MHC willing to amend Chateau bid.</title>
<headline>MHC willing to amend Chateau bid.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manufactured Home Communities Inc said Wednesday it would consider amending its bid for Chateau Properties Inc, including offering a tax-deferred option for operating partnership unit holders.</p>
<p>MHC said it would also be willing to consider an enhanced offer to shareholders and operating partnership unit holders seeking immediate liquidity.</p>
</text>
